"{\"url\":\"https://www.microcision.com/equipment\",\"title\":\"EQUIPMENT | Microcision\",\"desc\":null,\"og\":null,\"robots\":null,\"imgs\":[\"Microcision logo.png | 31e942_ef154a865afe4fa79723417987ebbaeb~mv2.png\",\"IMG_1663-Edit.jpg | 31e942_09a1c84d9fea412995bf735084e187f0~mv2_d_5472_3648_s_4_2.jpg\",\"_MG_1987.jpg | 31e942_39507185df2f4b55b4a89eff939468c3~mv2_d_3648_5472_s_4_2.jpg\"],\"form\":[],\"iframes\":[],\"sha256\":\"9b1a9bd0a3a275c00becbcc2ccc720cea07672d99cb385a4beb753ae78cdff15\",\"text\":\"Skip to Main Content\\n\\nHOME\\n\\nSERVICES\\n\\nABOUT\\n\\nEXPANSION\\n\\nCAREERS\\n\\nCONTACT\\n\\nOUR EQUIPMENT\\n\\nMicrocision is located in Pennsauken, New Jersey, minutes from downtown Philadelphia and employs 85 people: operating two full shifts, six days per week.\\n\\n\\u200b\\n\\nWith over 50 CNCs, Microcision utilizes a full range of advanced Swiss CNC, 5 -Axis Milling, EDM and many other types of advanced production equipment. Finishing, Assembly, Cleaning, Inspection and Packaging are all performed by staff members with extensive training in our custom-designed facility.\\n\\nPlease contact John Gray jgray@microcision.com\\u00a0for a full equipment list.\\n\\n\\u00a9 2022\\u00a0by Microcision LLC\"}"
